  m_text: 'In this task, you will be presented with 16 food items and an empty plate.


    Please select four foods that you would prefer to include in your meal.


    Point at a food item and press the controller trigger to place it on your plate. You can remove a selected food by clicking it again.


    You may change your selections before confirming your final choices.


    Once you have selected four foods, press Confirm Selection to complete the task.


    When you are ready, press Start to begin.'
